<tr>
<td><code>status</code></td>
<td>string</td>
<td>always</td>
<td>The current status: <code>new</code> (no ping yet, or resumed), <code>up</code>, <code>grace</code> (the ping is late, but the grace time has not run out), <code>down</code> or <code>paused</code>.</td>
