<h2 class="rule" id="create-check">Create a Check</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>POST SITE_ROOT/api/v3/checks/
</code></pre></div>

<p>Creates a new check and returns it, its ping URL included. Every field is optional,
and an omitted field takes its default, so an empty body creates a check with the
default period and grace time.</p>
<p>With this API call, you can create both Simple and Cron checks:</p>
<ul>
<li>To create a Simple check, specify the <code>timeout</code> parameter.</li>
<li>To create a Cron (or OnCalendar) check, specify the <code>schedule</code> and <code>tz</code> parameters.</li>
</ul>
<p>With the <code>unique</code> field, the call first looks for an existing check and updates it
instead of creating a duplicate (an "upsert").</p>
<p><strong>Authentication:</strong> a read-write key, in the <code>X-Api-Key</code> header or as an <code>api_key</code>
field of the body.</p>
