<h2 class="rule" id="list-pings">List check's logged pings</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>GET SITE_ROOT/api/v3/checks/&lt;uuid&gt;/pings/
</code></pre></div>

<p>Returns a list of pings this check has received, ignored ones included.</p>
<p>This endpoint returns pings in reverse order (most recent first), and the total
