<h2 class="rule" id="ping-body">Get a ping's logged body</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>GET SITE_ROOT/api/v3/checks/&lt;uuid&gt;/pings/&lt;n&gt;/body
</code></pre></div>

<p>Returns a ping's logged body. The response always has the <code>Content-Type: text/plain</code>
response header and the ping body is returned verbatim in the response body: the
bytes the ping sent, up to the first PING_BODY_LIMIT bytes, which need not be
valid UTF-8. The <code>body_url</code> field of <a href="#list-pings">the ping list</a> is this URL.</p>
<p><strong>Authentication:</strong> a read-write key, in the <code>X-Api-Key</code> header. A read-only key gets
"401 wrong api key".</p>
<h3>Parameters</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Name</th>
<th>In</th>
<th>Type and allowed values</th>
<th>Required</th>
<th>Default</th>
<th>Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>uuid</code></td>
<td>path</td>
<td>UUID, lowercase with dashes</td>
<td>yes</td>
<td></td>
<td>The check.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>n</code></td>
<td>path</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>yes</td>
<td></td>
<td>The ping's <code>n</code> from <a href="#list-pings">the ping list</a>.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>Example</h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>curl<span class="w"> </span>SITE_ROOT/api/v3/checks/f618072a-7bde-4eee-af63-71a77c5723bc/pings/4/body<span class="w"> </span><span class="se">\</span>
<span class="w">    </span>--header<span class="w"> </span><span class="s2">"X-Api-Key: your-api-key"</span>
</code></pre></div>

<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="kr">HTTP</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="m">1.1</span> <span class="m">200</span> <span class="ne">OK</span>
<span class="na">Content-Type</span><span class="o">:</span> <span class="l">text/plain</span>

Backup finished, 42 files
</code></pre></div>

<h3>Errors</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Status</th>
<th>Body</th>
<th>When</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>401</td>
<td><code>{"error": "wrong api key"}</code></td>
<td>The key is a read-only key.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
