<h2 class="rule" id="bounces">Receive Email Bounces</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>POST SITE_ROOT/api/v3/bounces/
</code></pre></div>

<p>An internal endpoint, not for API clients: the outgoing mail service posts delivery
failure reports here, as raw email messages. A permanent failure of an alert email
disables that email integration, and a permanent failure of a report email turns
reports and reminders off. It answers 200 to every request, and acts only on messages
addressed with a valid signature from the last 48 hours.</p>